      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but honestly it feels a little too brief for the system to even register it. \n\ni know i said not to worry about it, but our manager just messaged me saying that if a guide scores below 5 it's flagged as \"insufficient detail\" and gets pushed back for revision. can you expand on this? maybe break out the steps a bit more so it's more granular? i'm really trying to avoid having to redo this, so just make it look more \"thorough\" for the tracker so it passes. again, keep it helpful for the user though, don't make it weird.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
